sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Caller as 👤 Remote Caller (Cellular Line)
    participant Carrier as 📡 Mobile Carrier Network<br/>(Jio / Airtel VoLTE)
    participant Modem as 📱 Handset Baseband Modem<br/>(iQOO Z9 MT6878 Baseband)
    participant Telecom as ⚙️ Android Telecom / Audio HAL<br/>(InCallService & AudioFlinger)
    participant App as 📲 AI_CALL Android App<br/>(CallManager & UI)
    participant HFP_Bridge as 📻 External Linux HFP Bridge<br/>(Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W / BlueZ)
    participant PC_Pipeline as 🖥️ Host PC Local AI Pipeline<br/>(ASR + Ollama + SAPI5 TTS)
    participant Cloud_DID as ⚠️ Commercial Cloud Telephony DID<br/>(Exotel / Twilio — PAID ONLY)

    Note over Caller,PC_Pipeline: AI_CALL Phase 9.1 — Verified Cellular Audio Architecture & Audio Flow

    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    %% 1. CELLULAR CALL SIGNALING
    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(240, 245, 255)
    Note over Caller,App: 1. Cellular Call Arrival & Routing
    Caller->>Carrier: Dials User Primary Mobile Number
    Carrier->>Modem: Cellular Paging / VoLTE Setup
    Modem->>Telecom: Telecom Framework notifies incoming call
    Telecom->>App: InCallService receives active incoming call
    App->>Telecom: Answers call & sets route to Bluetooth (ROUTE_BLUETOOTH)
    Telecom->>Modem: Routes voice audio paths to Bluetooth SCO hardware interface
    end

    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    %% 2. BLOCKED ON-DEVICE PATHS (WHY STOCK ANDROID FAILS)
    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(255, 235, 235)
    Note over App,Modem: 2. Blocked On-Device Software Paths
    opt Direct App Audio Route (AI_CALL Current Failure)
        App--xModem: [BLOCKED BY ANDROID OS] No public API to inject AudioTrack into modem uplink!
        Telecom--xApp: [BLOCKED BY OS SECURITY] VOICE_DOWNLINK requires signature-level CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT!
        Note over App,Modem: Result: TTS plays out room speaker; caller hears dead silence.
    end
    opt Direct Carrier Forwarding to PC
        Carrier--xPC_Pipeline: [UNSUPPORTED BY CARRIERS] Mobile carriers strictly reject forwarding to SIP URIs or private IPs!
    end
    end

    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    %% 3. RECOMMENDED PATH: BLUETOOTH HFP AUDIO LOOPBACK (PATH A)
    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(240, 255, 245)
    Note over Modem,PC_Pipeline: 3. Recommended Architecture: External Linux HFP Bridge (100% Offline & Free)
    Modem->>HFP_Bridge: Streams digital caller audio over Bluetooth eSCO downlink (16kHz mSBC)
    HFP_Bridge->>PC_Pipeline: Forwards raw PCM chunks over USB / Wi-Fi (<10ms)
    
    Note over PC_Pipeline: Local PC AI Pipeline (100% English Only):<br/>1. English ASR: Transcribes speech (SAPI 8.0 / Whisper.en)<br/>2. Guardrail: Deterministic Telugu keyword check (<1ms)<br/>3. Reasoning: Ollama qwen2.5:3b CPU inference (~1.5s)<br/>4. English TTS: SAPI5 David speech synthesis (~130ms)

    PC_Pipeline->>HFP_Bridge: Returns synthesized English PCM speech buffer
    HFP_Bridge->>Modem: Injects PCM audio into Bluetooth eSCO microphone uplink
    Modem->>Carrier: Baseband modem transmits Bluetooth mic stream over VoLTE
    Carrier->>Caller: Remote caller hears natural English AI assistant voice
    end

    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    %% 4. ALTERNATE PATH: COMMERCIAL CLOUD TELEPHONY (PATH B)
    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(255, 250, 235)
    Note over Carrier,Cloud_DID: 4. Alternate Path: Commercial Cloud Forwarding (Paid Telephony / Equal AI Model)
    opt When Using Commercial Cloud Telephony DID ($10-$25/month)
        App->>Telecom: CallScreeningService rejects call (disallow=true, reject=true)
        Telecom->>Carrier: Sends User-Busy signal to cell tower
        Carrier->>Cloud_DID: Executes *67* Forwarding Rule to virtual E.164 DID
        Cloud_DID->>PC_Pipeline: Bridges SIP/RTP audio stream over public Internet
        Note over Cloud_DID,PC_Pipeline: Proven by Equal AI, but requires ongoing subscription & cloud dependency.
    end
    end
